{"seq":31,"slug":"identity-platform-oauth","title":"身份平台与 OAuth 工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth","rating":{"composite":4.34,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 身份平台与 OAuth 工程\n\n身份是现代分布式系统中唯一贯穿所有层级的横切关注点。当一个请求从浏览器出发、穿越 API 网关、经过若干微服务、最终触及数据存储时，每一跳都需要回答同一个问题：「请求者是谁，它有权做什么？」OAuth 2.x 与 OpenID Connect 提供了回答这个问题的协议框架，而身份平台（Identity Platform / IdP）则是将协议落地为工程系统的核心基础设施。\n\n2026 年初 OAuth 2.1（draft-ietf-oauth-v2-1-15）正式合并了过去十年的安全最佳实践——PKCE 强制化、Implicit 与 ROPC 删除、Refresh Token 轮转、Redirect URI 精确匹配。与此同时 OpenID Federation 规范最终版落地、DPoP（RFC 9449）进入主流 IdP 实现、Workload Identity Federation 取代了 CI/CD 流水线中的长生命周期凭证。协议层的成熟意味着工程重心正在从「实现正确的流程」转向「构建可观测、可扩展、安全纵深的身份平台」。\n\n本 hub 聚焦 **OAuth/OIDC 协议工程与身份平台建设**，覆盖四个维度：协议基础（身份概念模型、授权流、ID Token）、平台架构（IdP 内部组件、令牌生命周期、会话管理）、安全纵深（威胁模型、PKCE/DPoP 令牌绑定、零信任身份）、以及工程实践（多租户身份、社交与企业联邦、身份可观测性）。\n\n**与相邻 hub 的分工边界：**\n\n- **authentication-authorization**：侧重认证与授权的基础概念（密码学原语、访问控制模型、RBAC/ABAC 理论），不深入 OAuth 协议细节与平台实现\n- **zero-trust-architecture**：侧重网络层零信任（微分段、mTLS Service Mesh、持续验证策略），身份仅作为信号之一输入策略引擎；本 hub 则以身份系统为第一视角，解决「从协议到平台」的完整工程路径\n\n读者完成本 hub 四章学习后，应具备为中大型平台设计、实施并运营完整身份基础设施的能力——从选择正确的 OAuth 授权流开始，到构建支撑百万级并发会话的令牌服务，再到建立身份层的威胁检测与合规审计体系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"身份协议基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"identity-concepts","title":"数字身份核心概念模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/foundations/identity-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"oauth2-grant-flows","title":"OAuth 2.1 授权流详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/foundations/oauth2-grant-flows"},{"seq":3,"slug":"oidc-id-tokens","title":"OIDC 与 ID Token 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/foundations/oidc-id-tokens"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture","title":"身份平台架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"idp-architecture","title":"身份提供者架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/idp-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"token-management","title":"令牌管理与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/token-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"session-management","title":"会话管理工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/architecture/session-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"security","title":"身份安全纵深","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"oauth-threat-model","title":"OAuth 协议威胁模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/security/oauth-threat-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pkce-dpop","title":"PKCE 与 DPoP 令牌绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/security/pkce-dpop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-trust-identity","title":"零信任身份架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/security/zero-trust-identity"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"身份工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-tenant-identity","title":"多租户身份架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/practice/multi-tenant-identity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-enterprise-federation","title":"社交与企业联邦集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/practice/social-enterprise-federation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"identity-observability","title":"身份可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/identity-platform-oauth/practice/identity-observability"}]}]}